  "commit_message": "fix(activate): honor FLOX_PROMPT in fish and tcsh when NO_COLOR is set (#4597)\n\nFixes DEV-241.\n\n## Summary\n\nThe `NO_COLOR` branches of the fish and tcsh set-prompt scripts\nhardcoded the `flox` prompt label even though both scripts default\n`FLOX_PROMPT` a few lines earlier, so a custom label — including one set\nvia manifest `[vars]`, as documented in `flox-activate(1)` by #4590 —\nwas silently ignored in those shells whenever `NO_COLOR` was set. bash\n(`set-prompt.bash:26`, `${FLOX_PROMPT-flox}`) a",
